caption: HyperGSD plugin library

The HyperGSD plugin library distributes the HyperGSD plugin family: the main plugin and its optional sub-plugins for contacts, contexts, priorities, references, ticklers and the trashbin. To register the library in another wiki, drag this link into it: [[HyperGSD plugin library|$:/config/HyperGSDPluginLibrary]]